  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_rival_01a",
      "hash64": "37DEC22B4066C998",
      "text": "故勒顿是古代宝可梦……\\n难怪没见过！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_rival_01b",
      "hash64": "37DEC52B4066CEB1",
      "text": "密勒顿是未来宝可梦……\\n难怪没见过！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_rival_02",
      "hash64": "169E9D8064C84F50",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]！现在立刻\\n让我和[VAR 0x0101(0001)]对战吧！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_botan_01",
      "hash64": "83B6F385AE7EA1A3",
      "text": "它现在正舒服地\\n窝在精灵球里。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_rival_03",
      "hash64": "169E9E8064C85103",
      "text": "啊，差点忘了……[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_01a",
      "hash64": "D0DB0588BEACC0F6",
      "text": "我也是刚知道\\n它是从古代来的……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_01b",
      "hash64": "D0DB0488BEACBF43",
      "text": "我也是刚知道\\n它是从未来来的……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_02a",
      "hash64": "D0DEED88BEB08105",
      "text": "以前我妈突然\\n带着那家伙回了家……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_02b",
      "hash64": "D0DEEA88BEB07BEC",
      "text": "以前我爸突然\\n带着那家伙回了家……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_03",
      "hash64": "6C5A0731BFB3E7B9",
      "text": "然后我们在灯塔的研究所\\n一起过了一小段日子。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_04",
      "hash64": "6C5A0831BFB3E96C",
      "text": "我答应一定会保密，\\n然后帮忙照顾了它……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_rival_04",
      "hash64": "169EA38064C85982",
      "text": "所以你才对它这么熟悉啊！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_05",
      "hash64": "6C5A0931BFB3EB1F",
      "text": "不过有一天，[VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\n对野生宝可梦动了粗……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_06",
      "hash64": "6C5A0A31BFB3ECD2",
      "text": "差点被附近的家伙们\\n注意到它的存在……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_07a",
      "hash64": "D0EFE988BEBEED6C",
      "text": "在那之后，我妈很快就\\n把那家伙带回第零区了。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_07b",
      "hash64": "D0EFEC88BEBEF285",
      "text": "在那之后，我爸很快就\\n把那家伙带回第零区了。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_botan_05",
      "hash64": "83B6F785AE7EA86F",
      "text": "毕竟是……\\n不同时代的宝可梦啊。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_08",
      "hash64": "6C5A0C31BFB3F038",
      "text": "嗯，要是让人知道了\\n事情就会闹大的。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_09a",
      "hash64": "D0F5F588BEC36D7E",
      "text": "从那以后，我就再也没见过\\n我妈和故勒顿。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_09b",
      "hash64": "D0F5F488BEC36BCB",
      "text": "从那以后，我就再也没见过\\n我爸和密勒顿。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_09",
      "hash64": "6C5A0D31BFB3F1EB",
      "text": "现在回想起来会觉得这很孩子气……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_10",
      "hash64": "6C5D8A31BFB6FC29",
      "text": "但那时总觉得我[VAR 0x1107(00FF,0101)]妈爸被那家伙抢走了，\\n心里特别不爽。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1107",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_11",
      "hash64": "6C5D8931BFB6FA76",
      "text": "所以以前我很讨厌[VAR 0x0101(0001)]，\\n而且不太想说这些。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_12",
      "hash64": "6C5D8831BFB6F8C3",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]，\\n……我一直瞒着你，对不起了。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_rival_10",
      "hash64": "16A1A58064CA92BF",
      "text": "这么让人兴奋的消息，\\n要是能更早点知道就好了～！[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_botan_06",
      "hash64": "83B6F885AE7EAA22",
      "text": "这些话应该在来这里之前说。[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_05_friend_13",
      "hash64": "6C5D8731BFB6F710",
      "text": "我、我说你们啊……[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
